==Spanish==

===Pronunciation===
* {{es-IPA}}
* {{rhymes|i|lang=es}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|es|la|sic|sīc}}, probably through a compound {{m|la|ad}} {{m|la|sīc}}. Cognates include {{m|es|sí||yes}}. Compare Portuguese {{m|pt|assim}}, Catalan {{m|ca|així}}, French {{m|fr|ainsi}}, Italian {{m|it|così}}, Romanian {{m|ro|așa}}.

====Adverb====
{{es-adv}}

# like this; like that; as such; [[thus]]; [[so]]
#: {{ux|es|[[así es la vida|'''Así''' es la vida]].|inline=1|[[such is life|'''Such''' is life]].}}
#: {{ux|es|Si no paras de hablar '''así''', vas a hacerme llorar.|If you don't stop talking '''like that''', you're going to make me cry.}}
# {{lb|es|followed by a subjunctive clause}} {{n-g|Used to express wishes of misfortune against someone, or to cast a spell}}
#: {{ux|es|¡'''Así''' reciba un dolor de cabeza!|'''I hope''' he gets a headache! ''or'' '''May''' he get a headache!}}

